; react-simple-maps@3.0.0 declares a peer dependency of react 16/17/18, but this
; project intentionally uses React 19 (see CLAUDE.md corrections log). Persisting
; legacy-peer-deps here makes every environment — local, Netlify, any CI — resolve
; dependencies the same way we already do by hand, instead of failing with ERESOLVE.
legacy-peer-deps=true
